{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_title", "source_sha256": "9f5420bb5a2d2b8d1beee4efca2f283feaf241bb22c4d53d96a92991d8c401b0", "ja": "UNI-ON@IR!!!! 福岡公演 DAY2", "zh": "UNI-ON@IR!!!! 福冈公演 DAY2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7149718ef8786cca4ae4cf91fc7d68b71c352cb74a68bf8a252e910d4201bad4", "ja": "UNI-ON@IR!!!! 福岡公演\n『Fairy STATION』DAY2を\n無事に終え、追加公演に向けて更に\n意気込む事務員たちの一幕です。", "zh": "这是UNI-ON@IR!!!! 福冈公演\n『Fairy STATION』DAY2顺利结束后，\n为了迎接追加公演，\n事务员们谈论心中展望的一幕场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "37fb8fde5cada87a618d3b97890cfa65c06051bb0e355489ea02db899531140e", "ja": "4月の仙台から始まったライブツアーも、これで\nひと区切りです。本当に本当に、お疲れさまでした～！", "zh": "四月起从仙台开跑的演唱会巡演，到这里\n也告一段落了，真的真的辛苦大家了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "ca371586bcea24a826ee92b4c3ab277fef5c3c7b039430bff996de9cec8c6504", "ja": "今日の福岡のステージでも、アイドルのみんなは\nキラキラ輝いて……。まさに妖精でしたね♪", "zh": "偶像们今天在福冈的舞台上也是那样闪闪动人……\n简直就像是妖精呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1003_101kot", "source_sha256": "66740ffa3fd8274b45a1f7e634a91c3cd398d4ea83ee80d565e7f38a4bdce53f", "ja": "ひらひら～。ひらひらひら～。", "zh": "飘啊飘～翩翩起舞～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "5f90f1444e1b8a1917053612cca18a920a5a0c791a9d51c2e6b3f3a4dbf67efb", "ja": "あっ、音無先輩もお疲れさまで、し……た？", "zh": "啊，音无前辈也辛、苦……了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1005_101kot", "source_sha256": "d569e6847a20d053d52404be60377318df9faad5e51607d2621d1b9c812f30b0", "ja": "いいえ、私は先輩じゃなくて事務員の妖精。\nアイドルの成長を見守るのが使命なの……。", "zh": "我不是你前辈，是事务员妖精。\n守护偶像的成长就是我的使命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "820bbee6900399320dd500388ea73a6157c259fe0f70908fd9f290c91969f5b5", "ja": "音無先輩……？", "zh": "音无前辈……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "5b6ae60d713fd86f852deb5ebf02613ae2210cebead8e45d9db789244e37452d", "ja": "……はっ、ごめんなさい美咲ちゃん！　ステージの余韻\nに浸っていたら、いろいろ妄想が捗っちゃって……。", "zh": "……啊！美咲对不起！我还沉浸在表演的余韵里，\n脑中产生了许多幻想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "766b4fe695488075367d4d434f6b0888e3b702942ad49c96d7db0fffd8c33c24", "ja": "コホン。美咲ちゃん。まずはライブツアーお疲れ様！\n影ナレはもちろん、司会も最後まで完ぺきだったわね！", "zh": "咳咳！美咲，要先跟你说声演唱会巡演辛苦了！后台广播\n自不必说，你连主持表现也始终都完美无瑕呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "dc16e6e4c0f1ee9d529bfe6fa9456eebac48f9adb5d72a0531ea4767f6ad014b", "ja": "あ、はいっ、ありがとうございます♪\n最初は司会なんて、絶対無理って思ってましたけど……", "zh": "啊，是，谢谢音无前辈♪\n虽然我起初担心自己根本无法胜任主持的重责大任……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "c77ef55503f70280ccec4ee56da4d74a044557093b6b925aa49caedbf9b9c3cb", "ja": "少しずつ慣れてきて、今日はもう開き直れたみたいで。\nとにかく、無事に終わって良かったですっ♪", "zh": "但也渐渐习惯了，到今天已经像是豁出去了一样。\n总之，演出顺利结束，真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "98716168e805b0101aca8135ec43f4d71b7588fedef657177daec44d51e8c1e2", "ja": "本当にすごかったわ。番組の視聴率もすごいって、\n{$P$}さんも喜んでいたもの♪", "zh": "你真的很厉害呢，节目的收视率也很惊人，\n{$P$}先生很高兴喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "89734e51ae2f7ad9b6ef873685d8818dd59ed9d505cd1dd3b5e78a1fc455327e", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか！？\nうれしいなぁ……えへへ♪", "zh": "咦！？真的吗！？\n好开心喔……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "c679b2cd30b6bb61810e6aba041dadb6b4e107b738439f8f14286478d46e5a9b", "ja": "……でも、安心するのは早いのかも？\nだって、ツアーはまだ終わっていないんだから♪", "zh": "……不过，要放心好像还太早啰，\n因为巡演可还没结束呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "1f3d38adb97cb2e3343b9b6aa756b34128b44bf6573a149f234751f6b8f593be", "ja": "え？　……あああっ、そうでした！\nまだ、秋の追加公演があるんでした！", "zh": "咦？啊啊啊……对耶！\n还有秋天的追加公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "a2f0f8f2fa76a508739c8141c2afdb831fee1534825504c4e9ba340e106bbbd6", "ja": "私、また滑舌の練習をしておきますね。\nあめんぼあかいな、あいうえお～。", "zh": "那我再多练几次绕口令来加强口条好了……\n和尚端汤上塔，塔滑汤洒汤烫塔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "9fa893b5a13dc4d66912e78efe347d4d4febfb3a84022ec388c784ce3f7ebcf4", "ja": "って、まさかその場で練習を始めるなんて……！\nうう、どこまで良い子なの！　良い子の妖精なの！？", "zh": "天啊，居然当场开练……！呜呜，天底下怎么会\n有你这种乖宝宝呢！难道你是乖宝宝妖精吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "24c0c54c2aa0d2622d5941cc8c3e3ae43e7b608b25a3bd5942a41913c5b9825c", "ja": "小鳥さん、美咲さん、お疲れ様です。\n妖精がどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "小鸟姊、美咲，两位辛苦了。\n请问妖精怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "dae70b7401d414665deae4b16267f70f2618d4d994241fd3a0bafbed23ea88e3", "ja": "あら、ステージの妖精の静香ちゃん！", "zh": "哎呀，是舞台上的妖精静香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "063077b830b92f071a4e17f43aaf19b934da5964d56dc58051c1b7400f402f0c", "ja": "や、やめてください。\nもう公演は終わったんですから……。", "zh": "请、请别这么说。\n公演都已经结束了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1020_102mis", "source_sha256": "734a41c925ee7d97dab0844bcec9289f54c89e7214ebb20b14c196d81bc88c2e", "ja": "ふふっ、静香ちゃんこそお疲れ様でした！\n二日間の公演、大変だったよね？", "zh": "呵呵，静香你才是辛苦了。\n连续两天公演，应该很累人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "2e0d57dc1349bfe4304c326c2f800fe199d1e64c58c9b65d600280479f542c01", "ja": "はい……あ、でも平気です。疲れましたけど、\nうれしい、って気持ちのほうが大きいんです。", "zh": "嗯……啊，但我没事的。\n累归累，但高兴的感觉更强烈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "c2cadd2c6afa891690e8356da8b2f519121478aefd1fb57fd31d36b1dbaa6717", "ja": "仙台の翼たちの公演から始まって。\n神戸では未来たちが頑張って……。", "zh": "巡演从翼她们在仙台的公演开始，\n接着由未来她们在神户努力演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "9e402a469f115745aa98c7155278487fc55f323580a90cca83a29781aec4c25a", "ja": "みんなが繋いでくれたバトンは、福岡のみんなで……\nしっかり、追加公演に繋げられたと思います！", "zh": "大家传递过来的接力棒，再由福冈公演的成员\n传下去……我想一定顺利传递到追加公演了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1024_102mis", "source_sha256": "77f729b201c0dadaba7be6e5a94b252aedb73f5548315389115cd179e5328d37", "ja": "静香ちゃん……！　うん、そうだよね。\nバトンはまだ繋がってるんだよね！", "zh": "静香……！嗯，你说得对。\n这场接力赛还没有结束呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "39b661a4d54ab53e28f5c936056e1eedff792ae4cdb32c01aaa017380426fbbb", "ja": "そのバトンは、きっと劇場のみんなで受け取って。\nそして……。", "zh": "剧场的大家一定会接下棒子，\n然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "71caaa8f0abb0b5d829f6b0a2ea890f796bce1b8f14fc42744f53d14cbbcce77", "ja": "みんなを応援してくれる、すべての人に届けてあげて。\nそれが、このツアーのゴールなのかな……。なんて♪", "zh": "要传递给所有支持你们的人喔。\n那就是这场巡演的终点吧……说笑的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1027_102mis", "source_sha256": "a31e3a2befb1842ca05329c0008f4105a0e9cb0b2ed9f5b92d9345645e05682f", "ja": "音無先輩……！", "zh": "音无前辈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "f7c5354e0c27e0d470771d457b9846bc3cd274df2441138cefb75dbae4b36666", "ja": "ああっ！？　違います小鳥さん、\nそうじゃないんです！", "zh": "啊啊！？不对，小鸟姊，\n不是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "1cc164e4414f76ec2de3ea74a1b3182950a8ccaf168ede4938d0f91a2e3fc52d", "ja": "ええっ！？　な、何かまずかった？　いま、\n結構いいこと言えた～とか思ってたんだけど……？", "zh": "咦咦！？哪、哪里不对？我觉得\n自己刚才讲得还挺～好的啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "ef6b5c2ff5f4cf798ff1ea56de39d2e4d51aa422ecb47eb24a35a3cda5453bbf", "ja": "い、いえ、それはいいんですけど、そうじゃなくて！\nケータリングのうどんが茹で上がったんです！", "zh": "不、不是啦，是讲得挺好的，但我要说的事情是，\n外烩的乌龙面煮好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "b44e7419946f522c01d8535fb024f63c6410bfdf41caff3f613d6cb305a68e82", "ja": "早く戻って来てください。\nのびちゃいますから！", "zh": "请快点回来，\n不然面会烂掉的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1032_101kot", "source_sha256": "257e3186c20a1c4c83bd674f71dd728ed5a487999307bab3c769e6ce8837de6c", "ja": "あ、そういうこと……ふふっ、わかったわ！\nそれじゃ美咲ちゃん、戻りましょうか。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样……呵呵，我知道了！\n那美咲，我们回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1033_102mis", "source_sha256": "8e5f5d3dd60b731d692cb38836c85cc40527fa2dbcd25edd167ec381879f02d1", "ja": "はいっ！　福岡の美味しいおうどんが伸びる前に、\n楽屋に戻って。それから……。", "zh": "好的！在美味的福冈乌龙面烂掉之前\n回到休息室，然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_08_1034_102mis", "source_sha256": "bff914590951bfc51dde082a49cecbda02a85a5fdd8e5efd97f3abcaae5021f5", "ja": "追加公演のアリーナで、みんなでバトンを受け取る\nために！　私たちの劇場に戻りましょう～♪", "zh": "为了和大家一起前往竞技场，在追加公演\n接下接力赛的棒子！回到我们的剧场吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
